Incident Summary (Example)

Issue:
Users reported that the application on VM APP-SRV-01 was very slow.
Root Cause:
The /tmp directory inside the VM was full, which caused the application to fail when writing temporary data during the batch job.
Actions Taken:
We checked the VM resources, datastore IOPS, and filesystem usage. Then we cleaned up unnecessary temporary files in /tmp and freed up disk space.
Current Status:
The VM is running normally, and the application team has confirmed that the system performance is back to normal.

🧩 我给你拆解一下这些句子（方便你学习）
1️⃣ 描述问题（Issue）

“Users reported that the application on VM APP-SRV-01 was very slow.”


Users reported… 用户反馈……
the application was very slow 应用很慢

你也可以换成：

“We received a report that the VM APP-SRV-01 was running slowly.”


2️⃣ 根因（Root Cause）

“The /tmp directory inside the VM was full, which caused the application to fail when writing temporary data during the batch job.”

关键结构：

X was full, which caused Y → “X 满了，导致 Y 问题”
“temporary data” → 临时数据
“batch job” → 批处理任务

你以后可以替换成：

/var/log was full
the datastore had high latency
the network link was unstable


3️⃣ 处理动作（Actions Taken）

“We checked the VM resources, datastore IOPS, and filesystem usage. Then we cleaned up unnecessary temporary files in /tmp and freed up disk space.”

常用结构：

We checked ... → 我们检查了……
Then we ... → 随后我们……
cleaned up unnecessary files → 清理无用文件
freed up disk space → 释放了磁盘空间


4️⃣ 当前状态（Current Status）

“The VM is running normally, and the application team has confirmed that the system performance is back to normal.”

非常标准的收尾句：

is running normally → 运行正常
has confirmed → 已确认
is back to normal → 已恢复正常


